The reason to avoid conflict on the Astral Plane is that, if you enter
the level and have conflict, the game will generate four angry angels
around you and you won't get your guardian angel minion.  Further, if
you put on a ring of conflict during the level, your angel will
immediately vanish and the four angry angels will be generated around
your position.

However, in a recent ascension of mine in which my guardian angel got
killed, I put on my ring of conflict out of panic and noticed that, if
your minion angel is dead, the conflict angels are *not* generated
around you.

Even with the angries, Astral is indeed much easier with conflict, due
to its distributing enemy hits away from you.  Anything that results in
fewer Rider hits upon your person is good.

